    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Дела хорошо пошли?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Business is going well?' Barinov greets his supplier Timur and asks if business is going well.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "timur",
      "t": "Много работы.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'A lot of work.' Timur replies that he has his hands full with work lately.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "timur",
      "t": "Я взял племянника.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I hired my nephew.' Because he is so busy, Timur explains that he hired his nephew to help.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "timur",
      "t": "Его зовут Суслан.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'His name is Suslan.' He introduces the young man as Suslan.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Что ты привёз?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What did you bring?' Looking at the crates, Viktor asks what supplies Timur brought today.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "timur",
      "t": "Суслан, разгружай.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Suslan, unload.' Timur turns and orders his nephew to unload the van.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "suslan",
      "t": "Я нанимался водителем.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I was hired as a driver.' Suslan protests that he took the job to be a driver.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "suslan",
      "t": "А не грузчиком.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Not as a loader.' He insists he did not sign up to carry heavy boxes.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "timur",
      "t": "Вот скотина.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What a bastard.' Annoyed by his nephew's attitude, Timur mutters an insult under his breath.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "timur",
      "t": "Вот ваша рыба, шеф.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Here is your fish, Chef.' Carrying the crate himself, Timur presents a batch of fish to the chef.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Зачем мне рыба?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Why do I need fish?' Barinov stares at the crate and asks why on earth he would need fish.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Увози обратно.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
